  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 406.23 Disposal of Treatment Wastes",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 406.23 Disposal of Treatment Wastes. The proposal for disposal of treatment wastes and by-products required by Env-Dw 406.22(f)(4) shall:\n\n(a) Identify the volume and strength of treatment wastes and by-products expected to be generated;\n\n(b) Identify whether the expected treatment wastes or by-products are hazardous and cite the applicable rule(s);\n\n(c) Identify the state agency having jurisdiction over the treatment wastes or by-products;\n\n(d) Identify the method(s) proposed to dispose of the treatment wastes or by-products; and\n\n(e) Estimate the annual cost of waste disposal.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at part heading for Env-Dw 406) #10613, eff 6-1-14; ss by #14158, eff 12-25-24 (formerly Env-Dw 406.22)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-dw400.html"
